### 1. List all products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. Search products by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?q=laptop

### 3. Get product by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### 4. Create a product (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teclado mecánico",
  "description": "Switches rojos",
  "price": 49.90,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "electronica"
}

### 5. Update a product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro 14 v2",
  "description": "Portátil de 14 pulgadas actualizado",
  "price": 1399.99,
  "stock": 10,
  "category": "electronica"
}

### 6. Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/5

### 7. Non-existent product (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999

### 8. Invalid data (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 0,
  "stock": -1,
  "category": ""
}

### 9. Hello test endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hello

